       _p_a_m___n_a_m_e_s_p_a_c_e___h_e_l_p_e_r is a helper program for the _p_a_m___n_a_m_e_s_p_a_c_e module
       that sets up a private namespace for a session with polyinstantiated
       directories. The helper ensures that the namespace mount points exist
       before they are started to be used for the polyinstantiated
       directories. Mount points for home directories (lines with $HOME) are
       not created.

